        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX FH29PD8440, Arc Privacy Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arc Pocket Door Privacy Set locks a sliding pocket door shut and has an turn on the exterior for emergency use. It comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on a single pocket door, including 2 flush pulls and a mortise privacy lock that features a retractable finger edge pull. The Arc Sliding Door Trim is available in a wide array of finishes and depending on the finish you choose, the product will be made from either brass or stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/arc-pocket-door-passage-set-inox-fh29pd8010\"><b>Passage Set</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/arc-pocket-door-keyed-entry-inox-fh29pd8450\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arc Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass or Stainless</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2-23/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 5/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 5-29/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Depth: 3-41/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\", 2\", 2-1/4\", 2-3/4\", or 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Backset: 2-3/4\", 2-1/2\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-FH29PD8440-specifications.pdf?v=1704262378\"><b>INOX FH29PD8440 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a privacy mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
